    "content": "Sonpur Mela 2025: Special Trains, Fresh Buzz & A Smoother Journey Than Ever! If you have ever wanted to feel Bihar’s cultural heartbeat in one place, Sonpur Mela 2025 is calling louder than ever. The energy is rising, the stalls are ready, and now Indian Railways has stepped in to make your journey easier than before. This year, the Railway Department has arranged Special Trains to ensure thousands of travellers reach the fairground without stress. And that single update has already sparked excitement across Bhojpur, Arrah, and nearby districts. Why Sonpur Mela Still Rules the Hearts of Bihar Sonpur Mela is not just a fair. It is an emotion.People from Bhojpur have visited it for generations. Earlier, visitors even travelled by boats because no other options existed. However, things have changed beautifully. Now, families plan their trips days in advance, and they prefer the comfort, safety, and affordability of trains. The fair once again shines as a top attraction. Moreover, the festive atmosphere pulls people of every age. Many families want to explore the mela, taste the food, enjoy rides, and catch live cultural shows. Train Travel: The Smartest Way to Reach Sonpur Mela 2025 Travelling by train to Sonpur is not only easy. It is also the fastest and most convenient way, especially during the mela rush.From Ara Junction, several trains run straight to Hajipur and Sonpur via ",
